Z||000013||Fformula88||07-23-2001||05:35 PM||||The Fiero is remembered by most people as an plastic firebomb that was one in a long line of GM disasters.  If your putting together a television show like that, the Miatas and MG's and such that are remembered as great two seaters are going to be more popular than Fieros.  <P>Maybe it is a bunch of crap, but I'd certainly expect it and am not too terribly upset by it.  Like Ken said... it keeps them cheap to buy and maintain!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
